   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Two working files, both in draft/: Draft Markdown and Evidence Markdown.\n2. Same skeleton everywhere: C1.P1 to C1.P6, with B1, B2 under each.\n3. No run lists, dates or history inside either file.\n4. <stem>.md is the released Page; Delivery reads it and never edits it.",
   "originalText": "1. Two working files, both in draft/: Draft Markdown and Evidence Markdown.\n2. Same skeleton everywhere: C1.P1 to C1.P6, with B1, B2 under each.\n3. No run lists, dates or history inside either file.\n4. <stem>.md is the released Page; Delivery reads it and never edits it.",
